  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 803.05 Documentation of Claims That Recycled Materials Are Not Wastes or Are Exempt from Regulation. A person who claims that a certain recycled material is not a hazardous waste or is exempt from regulation under the hazardous waste rules shall comply with Env-Hw 401.03(j).\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12350, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
